# Art Direction

- White is predominant architecture — not clinical, not beige default.
- Black for text, figures, symbols, structure, precision.
- Rainbow = semantic vocabulary per node/action/state — not permanent iridescence.
- Cognitive Glass ≠ transparency everywhere.
- Reactive light on movement, pressure, orientation, state when it helps objects feel alive.
- Intelligent fun — not infantilization, not casino patterns.
- Combine Void Register + Living Object Register.
- Each node may have personality within global DNA.
- Do not make Life OS look government, banking, clinical, or generic Material clone.
